{"unit":4,"no":16,"title":"How-to videos","blurb":"Unit 4","VOCAB":[["difficult ↔ easy","","трудный ↔ лёгкий","қиын ↔ оңай",""],["big ↔ small","","большой ↔ маленький","үлкен ↔ кіші",""],["new ↔ old","","новый ↔ старый","жаңа ↔ ескі",""],["clean ↔ dirty","","чистый ↔ грязный","таза ↔ кір",""],["long ↔ short","","длинный ↔ короткий","ұзын ↔ қысқа",""],["heavy ↔ light","","тяжёлый ↔ лёгкий","ауыр ↔ жеңіл",""],["quiet ↔ noisy","","тихий ↔ шумный","тыныш ↔ шулы",""],["ugly ↔ beautiful","","некрасивый ↔ красивый","көріксіз ↔ әдемі",""],["old-fashioned ↔ modern","","старомодный ↔ современный","ескі үлгідегі ↔ заманауи",""],["press","","нажать","басу",""],["push","","толкнуть","итеру",""],["pull","","потянуть","тарту",""],["turn","","повернуть","бұру",""],["wait","","подождать","күту",""],["don't forget","","не забудь","ұмытпа",""]],"SLIDES":[["🔘","Press the button twice."]],"PICWORDS":["difficult ↔ easy","big ↔ small","new ↔ old","clean ↔ dirty","long ↔ short","heavy ↔ light","quiet ↔ noisy","ugly ↔ beautiful","old-fashioned ↔ modern","press","push","pull","turn","wait","don't forget"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"4_9":"A1_L16_4_9.mp3","4_14":"A1_L16_4_14.mp3"},"SEGS":{"4_9":[3.27,null],"4_14":[3.48,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>How-to videos</h2>\n      <p>Give instructions step by step — and describe things with opposite adjectives.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">What did the internet teach you this month?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap everything you watched a how-to video about.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>🍳</b> &nbsp;cooking</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📱</b> &nbsp;phone tricks</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🛠️</b> &nbsp;fixing something</div><div class=\"card\"><b>💄</b> &nbsp;style</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🏋️</b> &nbsp;exercise</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🗣️</b> &nbsp;English!</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Opposite pairs — and the instruction verbs.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_9',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.9 — the ten opposite pairs</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">difficult — easy · big — small · new — old · good — bad · clean — dirty · long — short · heavy — light · quiet — noisy · ugly — beautiful · old-fashioned — modern</div></details>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_14',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.14 — eight adjectives</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 modern · 2 cheap · 3 ugly · 4 easy · 5 quiet · 6 long · 7 big · 8 clean</div></details>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Listen to each adjective. Choose its opposite.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s3SSt3\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">modern →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">new</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">old-fashioned</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">expensive</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">cheap →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">light</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">old-fashioned</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">expensive</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">ugly →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">beautiful</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">clean</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">old-fashioned</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">easy →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">difficult</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">heavy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">old-fashioned</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">quiet →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">short</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">old-fashioned</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">noisy</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">long →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">small</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">short</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">old-fashioned</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>modern ↔ old-fashioned · cheap ↔ expensive · ugly ↔ beautiful · easy ↔ difficult · quiet ↔ noisy · long ↔ short.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Listen, then match each adjective to its opposite.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a word, then tap its opposite.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Adjective</b> &rarr; <b>Opposite</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s3GRt5\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>modern</b> <select data-answer=\"old-fashioned\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>ugly</b> <select data-answer=\"beautiful\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>easy</b> <select data-answer=\"difficult\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>quiet</b> <select data-answer=\"noisy\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>heavy</b> <select data-answer=\"light\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>clean</b> <select data-answer=\"dirty\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Listen, then match each adjective to its opposite.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a word, then tap its opposite.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Adjective</b> &rarr; <b>Opposite</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s3OOt7\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>modern</b> <select data-answer=\"old-fashioned\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>ugly</b> <select data-answer=\"beautiful\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>easy</b> <select data-answer=\"difficult\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>quiet</b> <select data-answer=\"noisy\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>heavy</b> <select data-answer=\"light\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>clean</b> <select data-answer=\"dirty\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"old-fashioned\">old-fashioned</option><option value=\"beautiful\">beautiful</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"noisy\">noisy</option><option value=\"light\">light</option><option value=\"dirty\">dirty</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Imperatives — the language of instructions.</div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“<b>Open</b> Settings. <b>Turn on</b> dark mode.”</div><div>“<b>Wait</b> four minutes.”</div><div>“<b>Don't press</b> the tea bag!”</div><div>“<b>Don't forget</b> your keys!”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> where is the word <b>you</b> in these sentences?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>Form</th><th>How</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td>Positive</td><td class=\"pos\">base verb</td><td><b>Press</b> the button. · <b>Turn</b> left. · <b>Wait</b> four minutes.</td></tr><tr><td>Negative</td><td class=\"neg\">Don't + base verb</td><td><b>Don't press</b> the red button! · <b>Don't forget</b>!</td></tr><tr><td>Polite</td><td class=\"pos\">+ please</td><td>Please <b>wait</b> here.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>Instructions start with the <b>base verb</b> — no “you”: Press. Turn. Wait.</div><div>Negative: <b>Don't</b> + base verb: Don't press. Don't forget.</div><div>Order your steps with <b>First, Then, Next, Finally</b>.</div><div>Imperatives are not rude in instructions — they are normal. For requests, use Could you…? (Lesson 11).</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — Complete each instruction.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ the button twice.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">You press</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Pressing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Press</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ forget your password!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">No</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Press</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ the door — it says PULL.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Pull</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Push</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Press</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Please ___ here — the doctor is coming.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">waiting</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Press</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">wait</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">___ left at the lights.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Turning</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Press</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Turn</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">___ videos all night — sleep!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Not watch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Don't watch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Nots watch</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Base verb first: Press · Pull · wait · Turn. Negative: <b>Don't</b> + verb.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “You press the green button.” (as an instruction)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">To press the green button.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Press the green button.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Don't open the window.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Don't to open the window.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Don't opening the window.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Don't opens the window.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Don't open the window.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “No press the red button!”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Not press the red button!</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Nots press the red button!</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Don't press the red button!</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>No “you”, no “to”: <b>Press…</b> · <b>Don't open…</b> · <b>Don't press…</b></p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___, take the phone out of your pocket.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Finally</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">First</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Then</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___, open Settings and find “Battery”.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Then</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">First</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Finally</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Put the “maybe” things ___ a shelf.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">between</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">First</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">___, enjoy your light bag!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Finally</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Next</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">First</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>First → Then / Next → Finally. Things go <b>on</b> a shelf.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Read\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Read</div>\n      <h2>Read</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Three 30-second how-to videos.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Read each script — and play it out loud.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"sayText(this)\" data-say=\"Phone battery dying? First, open Settings. Then turn on dark mode. The dark screen uses less power. Next, close your old apps. Don't watch videos! Finally, turn down the brightness.\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Video 1 — the battery</b>Read aloud by your device</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"sayText(this)\" data-say=\"Perfect tea in four steps. First, boil fresh water. Don't use old water from the kettle. Then warm the cup. Next, put the tea in and wait four minutes. Don't press the tea bag! Finally, add a little milk.\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Video 2 — the tea</b>Read aloud by your device</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"sayText(this)\" data-say=\"A heavy bag? Make it light. First, take everything out. Then make two groups: every day, and maybe one day. Put the maybe things on a shelf. Don't carry five pens. One pen is enough! Finally, enjoy your light bag.\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Video 3 — the bag</b>Read aloud by your device</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s6t4\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">All three videos…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sell a product.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">explain something step by step in under a minute.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tell a story about the past.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Three little problems, three step-by-step answers.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s6t5\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Dark mode uses less power.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">For perfect tea, use old water from the kettle.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">You wait four minutes for the tea.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">The bag video says: carry five pens.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Dark mode saves power · boil <b>fresh</b> water · four minutes · <b>one</b> pen is enough!</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s6t6\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Find a negative instruction from video 2:\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Warm the cup.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Boil the milk.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Don't press the tea bag!</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“Make it ___” — the opposite of heavy.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">short</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">light</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Finally</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Which word starts the LAST step in every video?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Finally</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">First</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">light</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Don't + base verb · heavy ↔ <b>light</b> · the last step starts with <b>Finally</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Before you read:</span> 30 seconds is very short. How many steps can fit — three, five or ten?</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>First,…</li><li>Then,…</li><li>Next,…</li><li>Don't…!</li><li>Finally,…</li><li>It's easy!</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write your own 30-second how-to script.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">Five steps: use First / Then / Next / Finally and at least one Don't.</p>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Teach your partner something — in five steps.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Choose something you do well. Then swap.</p>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Teach your teacher something — in five steps.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Choose something you do well. Then swap roles.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — think of something simple you do well (perfect tea, a phone trick, an exercise).</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — teach your partner in five steps: First… Then… Next… Don't…! Finally…</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — your partner mimes each step as you speak. Then swap.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — think of something simple you do well (perfect tea, a phone trick, an exercise).</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — teach your teacher in five steps: First… Then… Next… Don't…! Finally…</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — your teacher mimes each step as you speak. Then swap roles.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s8t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ smile! (negative instruction)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Don't\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ the button to start. (press)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Press\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">The opposite of difficult is ___.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"easy\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Instructions = base verb: Press\\u2026 Open\\u2026 \\u00b7 negative: Don't + verb \\u00b7 opposites: heavy\\u2013light.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s8t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">You press the button. (make it an instruction)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Press the button.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">No smile!<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Don't smile!\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Opens the window.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Open the window.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Instructions = base verb: Press\\u2026 Open\\u2026 \\u00b7 negative: Don't + verb \\u00b7 opposites: heavy\\u2013light.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l16s8t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Write the opposite: The box is heavy.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"The box is light.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Write the opposite: The room is clean.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"The room is dirty.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: Speak Russian.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Don't speak Russian.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Instructions = base verb: Press\\u2026 Open\\u2026 \\u00b7 negative: Don't + verb \\u00b7 opposites: heavy\\u2013light.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}